From cc32be958d7b85810c8688260e8cad20ab894c4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Balazs Rozgonyi <rbhun@me.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:04:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: optionally skip end credits using Plex credits
 markers

Import Plex credits markers as MediaVersion.CreditsStart and add per-channel
Skip End Credits / Keep End Credits settings that trim playout items at the
credits marker, optionally keeping the first N seconds of credits.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
